  "interpretation": [
    "The producer has no CPU frame pixel API, read_pixels, av_hwframe_transfer_data or rawvideo pipe; API captures cover device creation through destruction and contain GPU draws and Vulkan Video encode calls.",
    "Zero recorded image readback commands does not assert zero driver-internal copies. GPU internal copies, asset uploads, compressed packet buffer mapping and explicit CPU waits for GPU completion remain.",
    "Independent ffprobe and ffmpeg CLI validation decodes output after capture in separate processes; these are developer test dependencies, not producer or application runtime dependencies.",
    "Wall times are observations for this simple generated scene under capture, not a production export benchmark."
  ]
